tried Team Death match and Capture the Objective modes). Would definately recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1517594602, "timestamp_updated": 1517594602, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "39778179", "author": {"steamid": "76561198108870735", "personaname": "Some Random Dude", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sfasfasfas98797979/", "num_games_owned": 341, "num_reviews": 153, "playtime_forever": 1394, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 754, "last_played": 1615517712, "avatar": "b3aab2390ee2786a37696b7774ae87b86db1fdc5"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game does a brilliant job of making you feel like a space marine in tank-like power armor, I don't know much about the 40k universe but oh mah gawd this game makes you feel like a total badass, especially when you get your hands on the MASSIVE F*CKING SLEDGHAMMER, that combined with the jetpack makes you feel truly unstoppable, the multiplayer seems to be a bit lackluster from what I've played, but the singleplayer more than makes up for it", "timestamp_created": 1517524011, "timestamp_updated": 1517524011, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492850333452224731", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}